  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please please please make it an option to turn it off. I struggle with sensory issues due to being neurodivergent and it has caused me a meltdown when trying open beta and has now caused me a meltdown now that I can't get rid of it. The sound is muddy and too immersive, it sounds like everyone is inside of my ears and it's actually intolerable. I love VRChat but I will not be playing until I can turn it off.",
